      "message": "feat: remove features.mcp-cli flag, rename mount-as-clis to cli-proxy (#28842)\n\n* feat: remove features.mcp-cli flag, rename mount-as-clis to cli-proxy\n\n- Remove MCPCLIFeatureFlag from constants; MCP CLI mounting is now always\n  active when tools.cli-proxy: true is set (no feature flag needed)\n- Rename tools.mount-as-clis → tools.cli-proxy in ToolsConfig, parser,\n  schema, and all workflow .md files\n- Remove alwaysCLIMountedServers: safeoutputs and mcpscripts are no longer\n  auto-mounted; they are only mounted when cli-proxy: true is set\n- Simplify getMCPCLIExcludeFromAgentConfig (no more dual-access exclusion)\n- Update all test files to use CLIProxy field and remove MCPCLIFeatureFlag\n- Remove mcp-cli: true from 60+ workflow features blocks\n- Recompile all lock files\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/github/gh-aw/sessions/54c0f788-c290-4ae1-93ab-f3eaaa051b93\n\nCo-authored-by: pelikhan <4175913+pelikhan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* feat: add codemod to rename mount-as-clis to cli-proxy\n\nAdds codemod 'mount-as-clis-to-cli-proxy' that:\n- Renames tools.mount-as-clis → tools.cli-proxy\n- Removes deprecated features.mcp-cli flag\n\nRegistered in GetAllCodemods() and covered by 6 test cases.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/github/gh-aw/sessions/e26bc328-2349-4521-887c-e7619d4561e9\n\nCo-authored-by: pelikhan <4175913+pelikhan@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: pelikhan <4175913+pelikhan@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Peli de Halleux <pelikhan@users.noreply.github.com>",
